  "prefLabel": "Cmp 103.02 Response",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cmp 103.02 Response. The director shall respond to requests in accordance with RSA 541-A:29, and shall place any item requiring commission action on the commission agenda in accordance with the time frames of RSA 541-A:29. For purposes of this rule, \"an item requiring commission action\" means one which falls within the definition of the commission's powers and duties under RSA 188-F:62, including but not limited to the redesign of programs, fees, and the acceptance of gifts, grants, or donations.\n\nSource. #7368, eff 9-27-00",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/cmp100-300.html"
}
